s" href="../sign-up" class="h_link color-inversion-target w-inline-block"><div class="h_txt">REGISTER</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section data-w-id="afedfe31-667c-c7b3-0247-375a5e7af9ae" class="hero_article"><div class="wrapper_article"><div class="article_box"><div><div class="tag_category"><div class="dot_dec black"></div><div class="tag_txt">Travel Tips</div></div></div><div class="article_headline_box"><h1 class="h1_article">The best safaris you will look back on for a lifetime</h1></div><div class="date_time"><div><div class="date_article">October 27, 2024</div></div><div class="read_time_box"><div class="read_time">6 min</div><div class="read_time">lesen</div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id="cafe7420-bb79-1c7e-c1a0-8b5be32c0a9b" class="section_parallax"><div class="fullsize_image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5330464ab03718ece946_african-safari-adventure.webp" loading="lazy" alt="The best safaris you will look back on for a lifetime" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5330464ab03718ece946_african-safari-adventure-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5330464ab03718ece946_african-safari-adventure-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5330464ab03718ece946_african-safari-adventure.webp 1002w" class="image"/></div></section><section><div class="article_content"><div class="flex_article"><div class="voice_over"><a data-w-id="ddab0ff8-12df-a161-3538-2d6f1915d603" href="the-best-safaris-to-temember-for-a-lifetime#" class="voice_box w-inline-block"><div class="voice_first"><div class="voice_icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6713971095c4a7cab5d924ee/671d482bd7c1176b65d3fed6_listen.avif" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="listen_article start">Artikel anhören</div><div class="listen_article stop">Hör auf zu hören</div></div><div class="play_line"><div class="active_bar"></div><div class="passive_bar"></div></div></a></div><div class="content_article"><div class="description_box"><div class="description_first">A safari is much more than just a vacation—it&#x27;s an adventure that takes you into the heart of the wild and gives you unique encounters with animals. From the vast savannahs of Africa to the dense rainforests of Asia, safaris offer the opportunity to experience majestic animals in their natural habitat. In this blog post, Travel Next Level shows you the best safari destinations in the world that will give you unforgettable memories. Book your dream safari vacation easily through CHECK24 and enjoy the ultimate nature experience.</div></div><div class="rich_part_1"><div class="w-richtext"><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="Masai Mara wildlife and wildebeest migration" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5350dcdf71f909b7e100_masai-mara-kenya-safari.webp"/></div></figure><h2><strong>1. Masai Mara, Kenya — Home of the “Big Five”</strong></h2><p>The Masai Mara in Kenya is one of the most famous safari areas in the world. Here you can observe the “Big Five” — lions, leopards, elephants, rhinos, and buffalos — in their natural environment. The annual wildebeest migration, during which hundreds of thousands of wildebeests and zebras cross the Mara River, is particularly spectacular.</p><h2>‍<strong>Recommended hotels &amp; resorts</strong></h2><ul role="list"><li><strong>Angama Mara:</strong> This luxurious lodge offers breathtaking views of the Masai Mara and first-class safari tours.</li><li><strong>Mara Serena Safari Lodge:</strong> Located in the heart of the reserve, this hotel is perfect for experiencing wildlife right on your doorstep.</li><li><strong>Sarova Mara Game Camp:</strong> A luxurious tented camp with comfortable accommodations and guided game drives.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Game drives at sunrise and sunset.</li><li>The balloon rides over the Masai Mara with spectacular bird&#x27;s-eye views.</li><li>Visit a traditional Masai village to learn more about Masai culture.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D58%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in the Masai Mara here: CHECK24 - Kenya Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Elephants on safari in Kruger Park" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f5389af629b7b765b5f7e_kruger-national-park-safari.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>2. Kruger National Park, South Africa — One of the oldest and best safari destinations</strong></h2><p>Kruger National Park is one of the most famous national parks in the world and offers spectacular safari experiences. With a wide variety of animal species, including the “Big Five,” crocodiles, giraffes, and wild dogs, this park is an absolute must for every safari lover.</p><h2>‍<strong>Recommended hotels &amp; resorts</strong></h2><ul role="list"><li><strong>Sabi Sabi Earth Lodge: </strong>One of the most luxurious lodges in the private Sabi Sands Game Reserve, which borders Kruger National Park.</li><li><strong>Singita Lebombo Lodge:</strong> This lodge offers modern elegance and impressive views of the N&#x27;wanetsi River.</li><li><strong>Lion Sands River Lodge: </strong>A first-class safari experience right on the riverbank, where animals regularly come to drink.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Guided game drives in open off-road vehicles.</li><li>Night drives to spot nocturnal animals such as leopards and hyenas.</li><li>Guided bush walks with experienced rangers.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D107%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in Kruger National Park here: CHECK24 - South Africa Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Wildebeests crossing the Serengeti plains" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f53b7ae66f90dd204badb_serengeti-tanzania-migration.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>3. Serengeti, Tanzania — The famous “Endless Plain”</strong></h2><p>The Serengeti in Tanzania is world-famous for its vast, open plains and spectacular wildlife. Here you can experience the impressive Great Migration, during which over 1.5 million wildebeests and hundreds of thousands of zebras and gazelles migrate from the Serengeti to the Masai Mara.</p><h3><strong>Recommended hotels &amp; resorts</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Four Seasons Safari Lodge Serengeti:</strong> Luxurious suites with direct views of the wildlife and an infinity pool overlooking a waterhole.</li><li><strong>Serengeti Serena Safari Lodge:</strong> A traditional Maasai-style lodge offering first-class game drives and bird watching.</li><li><strong>Sayari Camp: </strong>An exclusive camp in the northern Serengeti area, ideal for watching the river crossings during the migration.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Day and night safaris in open jeeps.</li><li>Hot air balloons ride over the vast plains of the Serengeti.</li><li>Visit Olduvai Gorge, one of the most important prehistoric sites in human history.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D109%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in the Serengeti here: CHECK24 - Tanzania Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Elephants by Chobe River at sunset" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f54509565683115a2b379_chobe-national-park-elephants.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>4. Chobe National Park, Botswana — The elephant hotspot</strong></h2><p>Chobe National Park in Botswana is known for its huge herds of elephants that gather along the Chobe River. In addition to the classic jeep safari, you can also go on a boat safari here and observe elephants, crocodiles, and hippos from the water.</p><h2>‍<strong>Recommended hotels &amp; resorts</strong></h2><ul role="list"><li><strong>Chobe Game Lodge:</strong> The only hotel within the national park with breathtaking views of the Chobe River.</li><li><strong>Savute Safari Lodge: </strong>An exclusive camp in the remote Savute region, ideal for observing big cats.</li><li><strong>Muchenje Safari Lodge: </strong>This lodge offers first-class safaris and is located in the western region of the park.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Boat safaris on the Chobe River with unique wildlife viewing opportunities.</li><li>Classic game drives to see elephants, lions, and other wildlife.</li><li>Visit the impressive Victoria Falls, which are only a short drive away.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FareaId%3D1164%26hotelId%3D1079141%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3DcategoryDistribution%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26dhs%3D1079141%26ds%3Dh%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in Chobe National Park here: CHECK24 - Botswana Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Mokoro canoe safari in Okavango Delta" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f54909565683115a2ba44_okavango-delta-botswana.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>5. Okavango Delta, Botswana — A unique natural wonder</strong></h2><p>The Okavango Delta in Botswana is one of the most extraordinary natural paradises in the world. Here, the Okavango River flows inland and forms a huge swamp area where you can observe hippos, elephants, buffalos, and numerous bird species. The delta is particularly well known for its mokoro tours — traditional canoe trips that allow you to experience the animals up close.</p><h3><strong>Recommended hotels &amp; resorts</strong></h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Belmond Eagle Island Lodge:</strong> A luxurious lodge in the heart of the delta, perfect for safaris and mokoro trips.</li><li><strong>Vumbura Plains Camp: </strong>A luxurious camp that offers first-class wildlife viewing both on land and on water.</li><li><strong>Chief&#x27;s Camp:</strong> This exclusive camp is located in one of the best wildlife viewing areas in the delta.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Mokoro tours through the delta.</li><li>Guided safaris on foot or in off-road vehicles.</li><li>Bird watching with over 400 species.</li></ol><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FareaId%3D1164%26hotelId%3D76516%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3DcategoryDistribution%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26dhs%3D76516%26ds%3Dh%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A" target="_blank"><strong>Book your safari in the Okavango Delta here: CHECK24 - Botswana Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Leopard in Yala National Park" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690f54c7b7f0575f57750961_yala-national-park-leopard.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>6. Yala National Park, Sri Lanka — Leopard safari in Asia</strong></h2><p>Yala National Park in Sri Lanka is known for its high density of leopards. It is the best place in the world to observe these majestic big cats in the wild. The park is also home to elephants, crocodiles, bears, and an incredible variety of bird species.</p><h2>‍<strong>Recommended hotels &amp; resorts</strong></h2><ul role="list"><li><strong>Jetwing Yala: </strong>A luxurious eco-resort right on the edge of the park, ideal for wildlife viewing.</li><li><strong>Wild Coast Tented Lodge:</strong> This exclusive, safari-inspired lodge offers luxury in the midst of the wilderness.</li><li><strong>Chena Huts by Uga Escapes:</strong> An exclusive lodge with luxurious huts that offer you unique wildlife experiences.</li></ul><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><ol role="list"><li>Leopard safaris in Yala National Park.</li><li>Bird watching and crocodile sightings in the river areas.</li><li>Relaxation on the region&#x27;s pristine beaches.</li></ol><blockquote><a target="_blank" href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D678%252C685%252C688%252C1008%26c24pp_county_id%3D58%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D105%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D2w%26departureDate%3D2025-06-01%26returnDate%3D2025-06-15%26roomAllocation%3DA-A"><strong>Book your safari in Sri Lanka here: CHECK24 - Sri Lanka Hotels</strong></a></blockquote></div></div><div class="rich_part_2"><div class="w-richtext"><h2><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2><p>A safari is the ultimate adventure for nature lovers and animal enthusiasts. Whether in the vast plains of the Serengeti, the dense forests of Sri Lanka, or the river landscapes of Botswana, these breathtaking experiences leave lasting impressions. With Travel Next Level and CHECK24, you can easily book your dream safari and discover the best resorts and hotels that will give you unforgettable encounters with wild nature.</p><h2>‍</h2></div></div><div class="rich_part_3 w-condition-invisible"><div class="w-dyn-bind-empty w-richtext"></div></div><div class="rich_part_4 w-condition-invisible"><div class="w-dyn-bind-empty w-richtext"></div></div></div><div class="socials_share"><div class="social_flex"><a fs